# head/adult/ears_human: human ears on the adult head box (under the hair: long styles hide them)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult youth
role ears human
layer head
anchor head
keys rest
z 1

view D key rest origin 0 -9
|qt............sq
|qs............rq

view U key rest origin 0 -9
|qt............sq
|qs............rq

view R key rest origin -6 -9
|ts
|sr
|qr

view L key rest origin -8 -9
|ts
|sr
|rq
